{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Well I [G]pulled out of Pittsburgh [D]rolling down that Eastern [G]seaboard
[G]I got my diesel wound up & she's a running like never [D]before
There's a [C]speed zone ahead but [D]alright I [G]don't see a cop in [C]sight
Six [G]days on the road & I'm [D]gonna make it home [G]tonight
