{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
I got me ten forward gears & a Georgia Overdrive
I'm takin' little white pills & my eyes are opened wide
I just passed a Jimmy & a White I been passing everything in sight
Six days on the road & I'm gonna make it home tonight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Well it seems like a month since I kissed my baby goodbye
I could have a lotta women but I'm not alike some other guys
I could find me one to hold me tight But I could never make believe it's alright
Six days on the road & I'm gonna make it home tonight
{end_of_verse}

